Package: dataraft.catalog
Title: Catalog Components for DataRaft
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Jan-Hendrik", "Weinert", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "65009403+JanWein@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Publish product metadata to OpenLineage and OpenMetadata.
    Builds on dataraft.core, with optional dataraft.dbt integration for dbt
    artifacts and dataraft.lake integration for lake catalogs.
